<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>i do luv u</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">okayceci</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">i do luv u</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6LCSYQNqqXMVNWPoc2q8UE</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.001" end="00:05.161">[Intro]how do you know where I've been?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.161" end="00:09.582">Cuz I'm far away from you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.582" end="00:12.703">[Chorus]Cuz I just want your love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.703" end="00:17.831">I just want your kiss, kiss me all the way down,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.831" end="00:20.261">starting from my lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.261" end="00:25.058">If that's what you think then that's what I'll do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.058" end="00:29.963">I just wanna say that I do love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.963" end="00:34.936">I do love you,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.936" end="00:39.867">I do love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.867" end="00:42.828">[Verse 1]Seeing pretty clear, not so clear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.828" end="00:44.998">that was time before,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.998" end="00:46.773">I used sit in closets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.773" end="00:49.658">I remember clothes all on the floor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.658" end="00:54.697">I was wasting my time, you we're taking mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.697" end="01:00.184">What I gotta do, cuz I love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.184" end="01:05.513">[Chorus]I do love you,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.513" end="01:09.275">I do love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.275" end="01:14.090">I do love you,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.090" end="01:19.047">I do love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.047" end="01:24.118">[Verse 2]I'll do anything for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.118" end="01:27.298">tell me what's the price is it right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.298" end="01:29.517">Cuz I want you too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.517" end="01:33.488">I know I get some hate for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.488" end="01:38.643">But that's okay because you love me too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.643" end="01:41.038">[Chorus]Cuz I just want you love me,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.038" end="01:45.949">I just want your kiss, kiss me all the way down,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.949" end="01:48.395">starting from my lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.395" end="01:50.799">If that's what you think then</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.799" end="01:53.294">that's what I'll do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.294" end="01:55.748">I just wanna say that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.748" end="01:58.240">I do love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.240" end="02:03.712">I do love you,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.712" end="02:08.004">I do love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.004" end="02:12.845">I do,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.845" end="02:16.845">I do~~</p></div></body></tt>